# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit your actual .env file or API key to source control.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# ==============================================================================
# Option A: Free Zero-Billing Prototyping (Maps Demo Key)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any personal Google account (no billing account or Cloud project needed).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click to generate/reveal your Maps Demo Key.
# 5. Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and replace `your_google_maps_api_key_here` with your key.
#    Note: The Maps Demo Key has a daily quota limit and is for prototyping only.
#
# ==============================================================================
# Option B: Production Google Cloud API Key
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Create a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Street View Static/JS, Geocoding API.
# 3. Restrict the key by HTTP referrer and allowed APIs:
#    https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
